#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/lxqt/desktop/lxqt-session.xml:81
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of lxqt-session"
msgstr "Instalação do lxqt-session"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/lxqt/desktop/lxqt-session.xml:84
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>lxqt-session</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>lxqt-session</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/lxqt/desktop/lxqt-session.xml:88
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -e '/TryExec/s|=|=/usr/bin/|' \\\n"
"    -i xsession/lxqt.desktop.in &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release  \\\n"
"      ..                           &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -e '/TryExec/s|=|=/usr/bin/|' \\\n"
"    -i xsession/lxqt.desktop.in &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release  \\\n"
"      ..                           &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/lxqt/desktop/lxqt-session.xml:100
#, xml-text
msgid "This package does not come with a test suite."
msgstr "Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/lxqt/desktop/lxqt-session.xml:104
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the &root; user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/lxqt/desktop/lxqt-session.xml:107
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/lxqt/desktop/lxqt-session.xml:112
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/lxqt/desktop/lxqt-session.xml:115
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>sed -e '/TryExec/s|=|='/usr'/bin/|' -i "
"xsessions/lxqt.desktop.in</command>: If you are using a display manager, the"
" full path of the <quote>TryExec</quote> directive has to be given so that "
"the <application>LXQt</application> desktop will appear in the sessions "
"list."
msgstr ""
"<command>sed -e '/TryExec/s|=|='/usr'/bin/|' -i "
"xsessions/lxqt.desktop.in</command>: Se você estiver usando um gerenciador "
"de tela, o caminho completo da diretiva <quote>TryExec</quote> tem de ser "
"dado, de forma que a área de trabalho <application>LXQt</application> "
"apareça na lista de sessões."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/lxqt/desktop/lxqt-session.xml:123
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring lxqt-session"
msgstr "Configurando o lxqt-session"

#. Alternatively, if you wish the Window
#.       Manager of your choice to appear in the drop down list, include it in
#.       <filename>
#. /etc/xdg/lxqt/windowmanagers.conf</filename>. For <xref
#.       linkend="fluxbox"/>, include the line
#.     </para>
#. <screen
#. role="nodump"><userinput><literal>fluxbox/Name=Fluxbox</literal></userinput></screen>
#.     <para>
#.       and it will appear as an option in the drop down list. To change the
#. WM,
#.       after selecting it, you need to restart the session.
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/lxqt/desktop/lxqt-session.xml:126
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Window Managers other than <xref linkend=\"openbox\"/> may be used, e.g.  "
"<xref linkend=\"xfwm4\"/>. Please note that <xref linkend=\"icewm\"/> is not"
" a good substitute. <application>Fluxbox</application> does work, although "
"in this context (with <xref linkend=\"lxqt-config\"/>), <xref "
"linkend=\"openbox\"/> is better.  The configuration file "
"<filename>/usr/share/lxqt/windowmanagers.conf</filename> comes with many "
"examples of Window Managers and the ones which are installed will appear in "
"a drop down list of <command>lxqt-config-session</command>. For the ones not"
" included in <filename>/usr/share/lxqt/windowmanagers.conf</filename>, you "
"can use <command>lxqt-config-session</command>'s \"search\" button, e.g. for"
" <xref linkend=\"fluxbox\"/>, navigating through the file system until you "
"can choose <command>fluxbox</command>."
msgstr ""
"Gerenciadores de janela diferentes do <xref linkend=\"openbox\"/> podem ser "
"usados, por exemplo <xref linkend=\"xfwm4\"/>. Por favor, observe que o "
"<xref linkend=\"icewm\"/> não é um bom substituto. "
"<application>Fluxbox</application> funciona, embora nesse contexto (com "
"<xref linkend=\"lxqt-config\"/>), <xref linkend=\"openbox\"/> seja melhor. O"
" arquivo de configuração "
"<filename>/usr/share/lxqt/windowmanagers.conf</filename> vem com muitos "
"exemplos de gerenciadores de janelas e aqueles que estão instalados "
"aparecerão em uma lista suspensa do <command>lxqt-config-session</command>. "
"Para aqueles não incluídos em "
"<filename>/usr/share/lxqt/windowmanagers.conf</filename>, você consegue usar"
" o botão \"pesquisar\" do <command>lxqt-config-session</command>, por "
"exemplo, para <xref linkend=\"fluxbox\"/>, navegando pelo sistema de "
"arquivos até que consiga escolher o <command>fluxbox</command>."

